00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.700
I was able to meet my wife once again.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:35.350
Thank you, Ichigo, Kashino.

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.660
Blanc-san!

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.620
Keep on making many more...

