00:23:00.550 --> 00:23:03.230
Dream-coloured Magical Essence!

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:05.010
Tarte à l'orange.

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:09.950
Ichigo will make and demonstrate it to you.

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:13.380
Add in powdered sugar to well-beaten melted butter and mix it.

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:21.290
Then, mix in egg slowly, and also add in wheat flour, mixing it lightly into the batter before lumping them up.

00:23:22.240 --> 00:23:24.210
Flatten the batter into a tart ring.

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:30.570
And let it stand in the freezer for a while, and then take it out and bake it in a pre-heated oven at 180°C for fifteen minutes.

00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:34.440
Next up, the preparation of the cream avalanche inside of the tart.

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:38.040
Heat orange juice and shaved orange skin.

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:44.360
Add in a mixture of egg and granulated sugar, and then heat it up once more and keep it at 82°C.

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:51.720
After that, add in butter before spreading it fluidly over the tart batter. Then bake it in the oven at 180°C for 15 minutes.

00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:58.890
We just need to sauce it with syrup and it's done!

